WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,040
The boss treasure chest contains many types of resources.

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:05,320
But the quantity must be unstable, right? It’s not stable.

3
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:06,360
It all depends on luck

4
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:07,360
Then I'll grab the treasure chest

5
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:08,560
Can I sell it to you directly?

6
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:10,120
Just one gold coin is enough

7
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,080
Be safe if you drop the belt

8
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:12,560
Much safer than gambling on luck

9
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:14,360
This guy is really smart

10
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:15,680
You know I want to collect the treasure box

11
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:17,200
You also know how to act as a pawn for me

12
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,600
One is too few

13
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:20,040
I'll pay two gold coins to buy it

14
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:21,320
No matter what rubbish comes out

15
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,400
I cover all profits and losses

16
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,320
Two gold coins for a wool box

17
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:25,280
The boss is satisfied

18
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:28,650
Don't worry, everyone

19
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:29,650
Fly the team first

20
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:30,810
To avoid encountering other monsters

21
00:00:30,810 --> 00:00:36,510
Encountering a very dangerous boss alone

22
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:37,590
How would you like to arrange it?

23
00:00:37,590 --> 00:00:38,670
Let's just listen

24
00:00:38,670 --> 00:00:40,870
An is the same as expected

25
00:00:40,870 --> 00:00:42,830
In front of a wealthy boss

26
00:00:42,830 --> 00:00:44,590
My reputation is not enough at all.

27
00:00:44,590 --> 00:00:47,230
It's too dangerous to spread out. Everyone is free to form a team of at least five people.

28
00:00:47,230 --> 00:00:48,710
Check this building layer by layer

29
00:00:48,710 --> 00:00:50,510
Encountering many evil monsters, we set out for Ou
